# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/anskramkeep.lua:413 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/anskramkeep.lua:414 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/anskramkeep.lua:415
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/anskramkeep.lua:416
msgid ""
"Memorandum to all Soldiers\n"
"\n"
"The Drangheim threat has not been abated.  We need to keep to our watches in case they rise up again.  Just because we've sent General Ivsar's army out to meet the Drangheim army does not guarantee that we'll be successful.  Anyone caught sleeping on duty will receive a public beating from me personally!\n"
"\n"
"Captain Wilhem"
msgstr ""
"Oběžník všem vojákům\n"
"\n"
"Hrozba ze strany Drangheimu nepominula. Musíme dál držet hlídky pro případ, že by znovu povstali. To, že jsme proti drangheimskému vojsku vyslali armádu generála Ivsara, ještě nezaručuje, že uspějeme. Kdokoli bude přistižen, jak spí na stráži, dostane ode mě osobně veřejný výprask!\n"
"\n"
"Kapitán Wilhem"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/anskramkeep.lua:417
msgid ""
"Letter to Captain\n"
"\n"
"Captain Wilhem,\n"
"As you know, I was ordered to bunk with Sergeant \"Stinky\" Wilans.  I beg that you have a shred of mercy in your soul and order my sleeping arrangements to be reassigned.  I will even sleep in the storage room!\n"
"\n"
"Corporal Smit"
msgstr ""
"Dopis kapitánovi\n"
"\n"
"Kapitáne Wilheme,\n"
"jak víte, dostal jsem rozkaz sdílet ubikaci se seržantem „Smraďochem“ Wilansem. Prosím vás, mějte v duši aspoň špetku slitování a nařiďte, aby mi bylo přiděleno jiné místo na spaní. Budu spát klidně i ve skladišti!\n"
"\n"
"Desátník Smit"

