#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/ruinedtemple.lua:303
msgid ""
"Excerpt from Book\n"
"\n"
"..And Igdrasa said, \"Let light travel through the world\", and it was so.  Her worshippers praised her as being just and good.  All creatures mourned when she traveled on to the next world.  She bade them not to.  She asked that they remember her, and wait patiently for their time to join her."
